/// M07 CORE-018 "bundled fetch: 20 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/fetch_test.go symbol TestCurrentBundledFetch.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/fetch/main.can (read at L219,
/// staged pristine as src/main.can at L233; the header-default mutation at
/// L225-228 applies only to the run path, never the assert leg).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 20 roots: 8 native fetch roots plus the null-exchange
/// pretransport row, 8 selective-recovery consumer rows, and the extract,
/// main and referenced ordinary roots (Go L212-214), grounded per function
/// in main.can.
/// Live fetch semantics (methods, query, headers, auth, bodies, bigint,
/// error modes, envelope, invalid-header ordering) live in
/// core-018-fetch-semantics.can; the silent production process shape lives
/// in core-018-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the header-default restage
/// (Go L26-81), error modes (L258-266), invalid-header (L271-287) and
/// strict-tsc (L290-309) variants belong to the sibling files.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I26_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L99/L198), not an external gate. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 300000ms mirrors the Go 5-minute ctx (L90).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/fetch-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, load-json-roots, envelope-roots,
/// send-text-roots, send-json-roots, send-bytes-roots, head-roots,
/// delete-roots, options-roots, recovery-roots, extract-roots, main-roots,
/// referenced-roots.
/// Facet map (fetch_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L234-237: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L239: passed true); root-count pins
/// the twenty roots (L239: len assertions is 20; L212-214: 8 native plus
/// 1 null-exchange plus 8 recovery plus 3 ordinary); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the staged fixture (L219: main.can; L233: src/main.can);
/// load-json-roots pins load_json (fixture L14 decoded plus L16
/// unauthenticated, 2 roots); envelope-roots pins load_envelope (fixture
/// L28 delivered, 1 root); send-text-roots pins send_text (fixture L36
/// echo, 1 root); send-json-roots pins send_json (fixture L45 stored,
/// 1 root); send-bytes-roots pins send_bytes (fixture L56 roundtrip,
/// 1 root); head-roots pins head_text (fixture L63 probed, 1 root);
/// delete-roots pins delete_text (fixture L69 removed, 1 root);
/// options-roots pins options_text (fixture L75 allowed, 1 root);
/// recovery-roots pins load_or_default (fixture L158-165: recovered,
/// status, timeout, transport, invalid, credential, limit, codec, 8 roots);
/// extract-roots pins extract (fixture L153 first, 1 root); main-roots
/// pins main (fixture L83 sample, 1 root); referenced-roots pins
/// referenced (fixture L140 sample, 1 root).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
